# .gitignore -- Mighty Networks integrations
# Author: Jibril Sulaiman · Created: 2026-09-28
# Why: this repo is public. OAuth tokens here can read and send a real person's
# private messages, so token files, env files and send logs (which hold member
# emails) must never reach history. Once pushed, a secret is compromised.

node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.tokens.json
*.token
*secret*.json
send-log*.csv
recipients*.csv
!examples/recipients.example.csv
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
